{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57219","headline":"谶 八 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三四全无我，（三四者，七也。\n五祖七岁遇道信大师，无人我出家也）隔水受心灯。\n（隔水者，五祖於蕲州蕲水得传四祖心印，故言受心灯。\n）尊号过诸量，（过量者，弘字也）逢嗔不起曾（《天圣广灯录》作「从嗔不起增」。\n不起者，忍字也）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}